on nil "$z^2=53-3=50$, hence $z=\\pm\\sqrt{50}=\\pm5\\sqrt2$."] [:db/cas 17592186115781 :question/worked-solution nil "Without drag, $v(t)=2.6+9.8t$, so $v(4)=41.8\\,\\mathrm{m/s}$."] [:db/cas 17592186115782 :question/worked-solution nil "$k=25(9.8-7.4)/12=5$. Thus $v′+v/5=9.8$ and $v(0)=0$, giving $v(t)=49(1-e^{-t/5})$."] [:db/cas 17592186115784 :question/worked-solution nil "At terminal velocity, $0=mg-kv$, so $v=20(9.8)/5=39.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}$."] [:db/cas 17592186115786 :question/worked-solution nil "With negligible drag, $v′=g$. Integrating and using $v(0)=1.2$ gives $v(t)=1.2+gt$."] [:db/cas 17592186115789 :question/worked-solution nil "$k=30(9.8-8.2)/8=6$. The ODE is $v′+v/5=9.8$, whose solution with $v(0)=5$ is $v(t)=49-44e^{-t/5}$."] [:db/cas 17592186180169 :question/worked-solution nil "The remaining fraction satisfies $0.70=2^{-t/12.3}$. Therefore $t=12.3\\ln(0.70)/\\ln(0.5)=6.3292\\ldots$ years, or $6.3$ years to one decimal place."] [:db/retract 17592186115783 :question/answer-fields 17592186113665] [:db/retract 17592186115785 :question/answer-fields 17592186113667] [:db/retract 17592186125222 :question/answer-fields 17592186123932] [:db/retract 17592186125224 :question/answer-fields 17592186123944] [:db/ensure "answer-069c6bea-ab32-521f-a062-c6de7d83bad8" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-2e89cfdf-6df0-5ac2-b227-b93d6fbbde80" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-3292a683-51e6-5c78-9d23-8e8144abf37b" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-4fd178ce-5ee8-5a1d-9ebd-99d66f78bc84" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-61e06d94-5edb-5908-bc1e-a0a4fef96e77" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-93b888bc-9d45-5fa6-a81a-f803693f1795" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-f4b93b76-0570-5454-9e06-d9766b2f4d4a" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure "answer-f94cd29b-6bdf-5d81-966d-1bb44950c9cd" :answer/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186061519 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186061531 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186061537 :answer-field/validate] [:db/ens